(5, 'village', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'A village in Nepal after a powerful earthquake — cracked and partially collapsed houses, broken roads, scattered bricks, dust in the air, damaged stone walls, people gathered outside their homes, mountains faintly visible in the distance, cloudy natural light, realistic documentary photography style.', NULL, 1, 1, 'APPROVED', 1, '2026-10-03 10:04:22', '2026-10-03 04:19:02'),
